<title>UK: Whitbread falls after trading statement.</title>
<headline>Whitbread falls after trading statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Whitbread Plc fell after the company issued a disappointing trading statement, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1517 GMT, the shares were off 10-1/2p at 751p.  </p>
<p>The British brewing-to-leisure group said that while its sales grew eight percent last month, its margins were squeezed by higher food costs and additional promotional support in its take home beer.</p>
<p>&quot;A lot of people had very high expectations about the Christmas season,&quot; said one analyst.</p>
<p>-- Debra Sherman, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
